# Copy this file to `.env.local` (ignored by Git) and fill in your real key.
#
# IMPORTANT: a VITE_* value is embedded in the browser bundle and is public.
# Never rely on secrecy. Restrict the key in Google Cloud Console:
#   Application restrictions → HTTP referrers:
#     http://localhost:5173/*
#     http://127.0.0.1:5173/*
#     https://adb707a.github.io/saudi-explorer/*
#   API restrictions → Maps JavaScript API only (no Geocoding/Places unless needed).
#
# The main ORBIT experience uses MapLibre and does NOT need this key.
# It is only used by the optional #showcase Google Maps loader.
# Leave empty to disable that check.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_KEY=
